{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15254160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15254160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1525416001:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? 왜 갑자기 돌아오신 겁니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BC620A3F33B12D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? 왜 갑자기 돌아오신 겁니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? 왜 갑자기 돌아오신 겁니까?","variant_male_record_index":"193278","variant_female_record_index":"193279","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1525416001":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? 왜 갑자기 돌아오신 겁니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>？你怎么突然回来了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BC620A3F33B12D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? 왜 갑자기 돌아오신 겁니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>? 왜 갑자기 돌아오신 겁니까?","variant_male_record_index":"193278","variant_female_record_index":"193279","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1525416002:0":{"text":"마법사 협회가 또 신을 심판하려는 겁니까?","source_cn":"你们魔法师协会又准备弑神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802BC6571FE7FB4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1525416003:0":{"text":"나도 이런 귀찮은 일 하기 싫다고. 전부 너희랑 보칼리스를 구하려고 그러는 거잖아.","source_cn":"你以为我很想？还不是为了救你们和呼临。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A9E502E39022BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen